#: ../developer/about.md:1
msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

#: ../developer/about.md:3
msgid "The project and the lab"
msgstr "项目与实验室"

#: ../developer/about.md:5
msgid ""
"HybridInference is developed by the [Harvard MadSys "
"Lab](https://juncheng.seas.harvard.edu/) at the Harvard John A. Paulson "
"School of Engineering and Applied Sciences, and published under the [MIT "
"license](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/main/LICENSE)."
" The routing system at its center, RouteWise, is the subject of the lab's"
" EuroSys '27 paper and ships separately as the MIT-licensed [`llm-"
"routewise`](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/RouteWise) library; this "
"gateway is its production reference integration."
msgstr ""
"HybridInference 由哈佛大学约翰·A·保尔森工程与应用科学学院的 [Harvard "
"MadSys 实验室](https://juncheng.seas.harvard.edu/)开发,以 [MIT "
"许可证](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/main/LICENSE)发布。"
"其核心的路由系统 RouteWise 是实验室 EuroSys '27 论文的研究对象,并作为 MIT 许可的 [`llm-"
"routewise`](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/RouteWise) 库独立发布;本网关是它的生产参考集成。"

#: ../developer/about.md:14
msgid ""
"The people behind the project are visible where the work happens: the "
"[contributors "
"page](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/graphs/contributors)"
" lists everyone who has landed a change."
msgstr ""
"项目背后的人就在工作发生的地方:[贡献者页面](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/graphs/contributors)"
"列出了每一位提交过变更的人。"

#: ../developer/about.md:18
msgid "How to cite"
msgstr "如何引用"

#: ../developer/about.md:20
msgid ""
"If you use HybridInference or RouteWise in your research, cite the "
"RouteWise paper:"
msgstr "如果你在研究中使用 HybridInference 或 RouteWise,请引用 RouteWise 论文:"

#: ../developer/about.md:32
msgid ""
"The repository also carries a "
"[`CITATION.cff`](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/main/CITATION.cff),"
" so GitHub's \"Cite this repository\" button produces the same reference."
msgstr ""
"仓库中还带有 "
"[`CITATION.cff`](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/main/CITATION.cff),"
"因此 GitHub 的 \"Cite this repository\" 按钮会生成同样的引用。"

#: ../developer/about.md:36
msgid "See it running"
msgstr "看看线上实例"

#: ../developer/about.md:38
msgid ""
"[FreeInference](https://freeinference.org/) is the lab's own deployment "
"of this gateway. A deployment's identity — branding, team, sponsors, "
"user-facing documentation — lives with the deployment, in its overlay and"
" on its own site, not in this repository. That separation is why these "
"pages name no default provider and no team: a fresh clone comes up as "
"your gateway, not ours."
msgstr ""
"[FreeInference](https://freeinference.org/) 是实验室自己运营的本网关部署。"
"一个部署的身份——品牌、团队、赞助商、面向用户的文档——随部署走,放在它自己的 overlay "
"和站点里,而不在本仓库中。正因为这种分离,这些页面不会写死任何默认 provider "
"或团队:新克隆下来的是你自己的网关,而不是我们的。"

#: ../developer/about.md:45
msgid "Getting in touch"
msgstr "联系我们"

#: ../developer/about.md:47
msgid ""
"Bugs and questions go to the [issue "
"tracker](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/issues); "
"patches follow the [contributing guide](contributing.md)."
msgstr ""
"Bug 与问题请提交到[问题跟踪器](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/issues);"
"补丁请遵循[贡献指南](contributing.md)。"
